## 6‑Color Palettes for the Sixteen Valar (for Figma AI Designer)

Below are 16 hex palettes, each with six colors. The **first color** is the *Gravity Well* – the primary diagnostic hue that draws attention to this need domain. The remaining five are supporting shades (lighter/darker, adjacent hues, or complementary) for visual design (gradients, chromatic vectors, UI accents). Use these directly in Figma or any design tool.

